1
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:40,414
[on phone] As a doctor, I strongly recommend eight hours of sleep! Anyway, I haven't slept in three days. Follow for more!

2
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:49,985
[on phone] Twelve chairs. One jump. Let's GO!

3
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,139
[on phone] POOL DAY, BABY!

4
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:10,412
Okay... I think it's time to sleep.

5
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:04,750
Morning, Jeff!

6
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,005
...morning.

7
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:23,523
Jeff, the boss needs you. He wants to see you in his office.

8
00:02:30,450 --> 00:02:34,013
Jeff! Do you have any idea what you're doing?

9
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:41,550
Your work has been terrible lately. You come here every single day looking like you're dead!

10
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:48,952
The sales are going down. You're barely doing anything! Honestly, I'm going to have to fire you, Jeff.

11
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:51,003
Whatever, boss...

12
00:02:55,450 --> 00:03:00,371
ARE YOU EVEN LISTENING TO ME, JEFF?! I SAID I MIGHT HAVE TO FIRE YOU!

13
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:03,307
Yeah... whatever, boss.

14
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:07,397
GET OUT! We'll talk later. Go!

15
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:07,003
Who the hell are you? What are you doing in my place?

16
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,499
I was like that yesterday, Jeff.

17
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:12,883
Who the hell are you?

18
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:15,500
I am you.

19
00:04:15,700 --> 00:04:18,334
And you're in trouble.
